### jaehoon으로 로그인
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jaehoon",
  "password": "jaehoon1234"
}

### seoyeon과의 대화방 열기
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "seoyeon"
}

### 없는 사람과의 대화방 열기
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "nobody"
}
